types

// @documented
// @description A position of the grammar: the type of its `admet` member says what a name written there must resolve to.
def place(
  symbol admet,
  scope(rule, scene, registry)
)

// ── LE FLUX ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// @description Right of the arrow: what the rule produces.
place fluxDroite(
  symbol admet,
  scope:scene
)

// @description Inside the body a `def` binds to its name — the same place, another depth.
place corpsDeDef(
  symbol admet,
  scope:scene
)

// ── LES DRAPEAUX ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// @description The guard of a rule: `[section==1]`.
place gardeDeRegle(
  flag admet,
  scope:scene
)

// @description The mutation written after an element: `[section=2]`.
place mutationDeDrapeau(
  flag admet,
  scope:scene
)

// ── LES OBJETS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// @description The key of a settings bag: `C4(vel:64)`.
place cleDUnSac(
  control admet,
  scope:registry
)

// @description The tag of a backtick: the interpreter that runs the code.
place tagDeBacktick(
  eval admet,
  scope:registry
)

// @description The channel an actor writes to: `actor a(out.midi)`.
place sortieDActeur(
  destination admet,
  scope:registry
)

// ── L INVOCATION ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// Left of the dot: `alphabet.western`. It names a family of the registry.
// ⛔ `famille` IS NOT DECLARED IN types.bpsl — proposed name, awaiting Romain.
// place axeDInvocation(
//   famille admet,
//   scope:registry
// )

// Right of the dot: an entry of THAT family, never of another.
// place entreeDInvocation(
//   famille admet,
//   scope:registry
// )

// ── LES GABARITS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// The slave `&x` replays the master `$x` — of the SAME rule, the narrowest scope.
// ⛔ `gabarit` IS NOT DECLARED IN types.bpsl — proposed name, awaiting Romain.
// place rejeuDeGabarit(
//   gabarit admet,
//   scope:rule
// )

// ── LE POINT D ATTENTE — DEUX PLACES ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// `<!touches.Space` — left of the dot, the input role that can fire.
// ⛔ `entree` IS NOT DECLARED IN types.bpsl — the input counterpart of `destination`,
// proposed name, awaiting Romain.
// place roleDAttente(
//   entree admet,
//   scope:scene
// )

// Son union DERIVE du canal que le role ouvre : une frappe, une note qualifiee d un canal et lue
// dans la convention active, ou un message de transport. BP3 ecrit aussi `Wait forever` ; il ne
// passe pas ici (Romain, 2026-09-07).
// @description What arrives on that role — a keystroke, a note with its channel, or a transport message.
place occurrenceDAttente(
  destination admet,
  scope:scene
)
